        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>面试开口素材积累 DAY13 互联网—银发知播</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#e0632a;\n    font-family:\"KaiTi\",\"STKaiti\",\"Kaiti SC\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:540px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    background:#e0632a;\n    padding:14px 12px 18px 12px;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  .inner{\n    background:#fdf6ee;\n    border:2px solid #b8410f;\n    border-radius:6px;\n    padding:0 0 20px 0;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  .header{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    padding:16px 20px 6px 22px;\n  }\n  .title-main{\n    font-size:40px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    color:#c0390c;\n    letter-spacing:2px;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .day-box{\n    border:2px solid #c0390c;\n    border-radius:10px;\n    width:88px;\n    height:76px;\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    color:#c0390c;\n  }\n  .day-box .d1{\n    font-size:24px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-style:italic;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n    font-family:\"Comic Sans MS\",\"Marker Felt\",cursive;\n  }\n  .day-box .d2{\n    font-size:22px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n  }\n  .banner{\n    background:#e0632a;\n    margin:6px 18px 0 18px;\n    text-align:center;\n    padding:12px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .banner .btn{\n    display:inline-block;\n    background:#fdf6ee;\n    border:2px solid #7a2306;\n    border-radius:6px;\n    padding:8px 30px;\n    font-size:30px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    color:#1a1a1a;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .content{\n    padding:14px 24px 0 24px;\n  }\n  .sec-title{\n    color:#c0390c;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:19px;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n    margin:6px 0 10px 4px;\n  }\n  p.para{\n    font-size:19px;\n    line-height:1.9;\n    color:#1c1c1c;\n    margin:0 0 18px 0;\n    text-indent:0;\n  }\n  .num{\n    display:inline-block;\n    border:1.6px solid #c0390c;\n    color:#c0390c;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    width:20px;\n    height:20px;\n    line-height:20px;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:14px;\n    margin-right:2px;\n    vertical-align:2px;\n  }\n  .hl-pink{background:#f7b6b6;}\n  .hl-green{background:#a8e29a;}\n  .hl-orange{background:#f6c79a;}\n  .box-blue{\n    border:1.6px solid #2a6fd6;\n    padding:0 3px;\n  }\n  .u-blue{\n    border-bottom:1.6px solid #2a6fd6;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"title-main\">面试开口素材积累</div>\n      <div class=\"day-box\">\n        <div class=\"d1\">DAY</div>\n        <div class=\"d2\">13</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"banner\">\n      <span class=\"btn\">互联网—银发知播</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"sec-title\">二、意义</div>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">\n        <span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"hl-pink\">老有所为，实现人生价值。</span><span class=\"hl-green\">春蚕不老，夕阳正红。</span>“银发知播”退休之后并<span class=\"hl-green\">没有被数字鸿沟阻隔，</span><span class=\"hl-orange\">而是主动学习技术、利用技术、玩转技术，把“年老”的经验和知识用“年轻”的形式播撒到更广阔的天地。</span>不仅有利于自身发挥余热，也为更多老人树立了老有所为、老有所乐的榜样，这是<span class=\"box-blue\">自我价值</span>的一种体现。\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">\n        <span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"hl-pink\">科普出圈，提供平等机会。</span><span class=\"hl-green\">老骥伏枥，志在千里。</span>“银发知播”群体<span class=\"u-blue\">用精心的设计和精彩的讲</span><span class=\"hl-orange\">述，打破时空限制、城乡限制，让更多有需要、感兴趣、想学习的人有机会接触优质教育资源。</span>顶级专家、知名教授、资深教师们来到互联网平台贡献所学、授人以渔，为人们架设了通往知识神圣殿堂的<span class=\"hl-orange\">梯子，以一种崭新的形式保障了每个网民学习与思考的权利，</span>在新时代利用新媒体为<span class=\"box-blue\">“有教无类”</span>作了最有说服力的注脚。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
